  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPO Junior Professional Officer is a program that Sida started in     1963 targeting young Swedish academics. The objective is for Sweden   to increase the proportion of Swedes in multilateral development      cooperation, ie international priority organizations (eg UN, World    Bank)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JPO insatsen har ett MoU avtal, tj&#xe4;nsten ska rekryteras under maximalt tre &#xe5;r, tj&#xe4;nsten f&#xf6;ljs upp &#xe5;rligen av CAPDEV och WHO, Sida medger maximalt tre &#xe5;rs finansiering</narrative>
  </description>
